ek each day  people change their opinion if the  elections were two days or one week  after we would probably see different  results  marita colland waiting for news of her  son ill with covet says  she doesn't know if she will vote they  make so many promises  i hope their hearts are moved and they  take pity on the covert 19 patients  in such a fragmented scenario where not  one candidate holds more than 13 percent  of support in the polls  the only certainty is that there will be  a run of vote in june  [Music]  mariana peru
 

